MN29005 offline fault-injection test
===================================

Run from a kernel source checkout with Python 3 and a C compiler:

    python3 tools/testing/iio/test_mn29005.py

CC selects another compiler. The test compiles the actual mn29005.c with
observing I2C and runtime-PM stubs, then exercises transfer failures,
restoration, readiness, saturation, identity and ownership checks. It does
not access a device or replace a real kernel build, concurrency testing,
physical bus-fault testing or hardware power/suspend qualification.
